&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;2276e74b92f0&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Specifies architectural solutions to technical challenges across multiple technical domains.&lt;/li&gt;
